## 🔷 10. 🧪 PRACTICE PROGRAM

```java
public class LogicalOperatorsPractice {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int age = 22;
        boolean hasTicket = true;

        System.out.println(age >= 18 && hasTicket);
        System.out.println(age < 18 || age > 60);
        System.out.println(!hasTicket);
    }
}
```

### ✅ Output
```text
true
false
false
```

### 🔍 Explanation
- `age >= 18 && hasTicket` → `true && true` → `true`
- `age < 18 || age > 60` → `false || false` → `false`
- `!hasTicket` → `!true` → `false`

