## 🔷 11. 🧠 QUICK REVISION

| Operator | Remember |
|---|---|
| `&&` | Both must be true |
| `||` | At least one must be true |
| `!` | Reverses true/false |
| `&` | Boolean AND without short-circuiting; bitwise AND for integers |
| `|` | Boolean OR without short-circuiting; bitwise OR for integers |

**Final memory trick:**

- AND → Both
- OR → At least one
- NOT → Reverse
- `&&` → Short-circuit AND
- `||` → Short-circuit OR

